b930a1d-1400-482e-a535-48a0ed5abbd0","f640cacc-0b61-4785-8dc0-13ffba2bbc87"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"full_width":true,"gutter_size":10,"space_above":true,"space_below":true}},"3726c453-8c83-439e-b698-d1a457cb7052":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"template--14499584540801__3726c453-8c83-439e-b698-d1a457cb7052-1685739587c1f96430-0":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"How durable is the rolled rubber mats?","text":"<p>Rolled rubber mats are engineered for intense training sessions and frequent usage. It's endurance can withstand and resist barbell impacts. Its purpose is not merely to endure but to protect - safeguarding your subfloor from extensive wear and tear.<\/p><p>A common misconception is that thicker the rubber, the more durable it is. However, the reality is different - thickness primarily serves as a shield for your subfloor, protecting it particularly from heavier weights.<\/p><p>The true determinant of durability is density. High-density rubber offers supreme durability and strength, whereas low-density rubber lacks this resilience.<\/p><p><\/p>"}},"template--14499584540801__3726c453-8c83-439e-b698-d1a457cb7052-1685739587c1f96430-1":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Where can I use the rolled rubber mats?","text":"<p>The rolled rubber mats offers unparalleled versatility. It's the go-to choice for gym environments, but its usage extends well beyond fitness spaces. It's an ideal fit for playgrounds, outdoor locations, and any high-traffic zones needing resilient floor solutions. <\/p>"}},"bb66281f-373f-4578-aa0f-06839fa0c67c":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"How long does the rolled rubber mats last?","text":"<p>The longevity of your rolled rubber mats is contingent upon proper maintenance. By promptly addressing any required repairs, you can confidently expect your floor to last a decade or more. We take pride in our rolled rubber mats installations that, even after over a decade, are still delivering commendable performance.<\/p>"}}},"block_